      <li>Keys starting with <code>complianceoperator.openshift.io/</code></li>
      <li>Keys starting with <code>complianceascode.io/</code></li>
      <li>Keys where the domain contains <code>kubernetes.io/</code> (such as <code>kubernetes.io/name</code> or <code>app.kubernetes.io/</code>)</li>
      <li>Keys where the domain contains <code>k8s.io/</code> (such as <code>k8s.io/component</code> or <code>node.k8s.io/instance-type</code>)</li>
      </ul>
